{
 "about": "#127: the smith at grade 1: the hero beside the anvil, three bars, a pip lights at once after each bar, and the done line with thép. At 21:00.",
 "start": "?story=trial-smith&clock=1260",
 "lang": "vi",
 "allow": [
  "is under the bottom of the screen",
  "and the press did nothing"
 ],
